<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SCHARRIGHUISEN TALKS ON OVERSEAS DEAL ENDED.</title>
<headline>SCHARRIGHUISEN TALKS ON OVERSEAS DEAL ENDED.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scharrighuisen Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday that negotiations into an overseas investment opportunity -- which had reached the due diligence stage -- had been terminated.</p>
<p>It gave no further details in a brief announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
